    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27342" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δίπαις</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῐ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παιδος</span>, ὁ, ἡ,</span>
